d(2) = c_float_to_u8(b * 255.0f32);\",\"*base.add(2) = c_float_to_u8(b * 255.0f32);\\n        *base.add(3) = 7;\")'\nmutate \"reject-negative-dims\"    's=s.replace(\"let mut i: c_int = 0;\",\"if w < 0 || h < 0 { return; }\\n    let mut i: c_int = 0;\")'\nmutate \"off-by-one-bound\"        's=s.replace(\"while i < limit {\",\"while i <= limit {\")'\nmutate \"swap-g-b\"                's=s.replace(\"*base.add(1) = c_float_to_u8(g * 255.0f32);\\n        *base.add(2) = c_float_to_u8(b * 255.0f32);\",\"*base.add(1) = c_float_to_u8(b * 255.0f32);\\n        *base.add(2) = c_float_to_u8(g * 255.0f32);\")'\nmutate \"no-premultiply\"          's=s.replace(\"r *= a;\",\"r *= 1.0;\")'\nmutate \"row-stride-misread\"      's=s.replace(\"let limit: c_int = stride.wrapping_mul(h);\",\"let limit: c_int = w.wrapping_mul(h);\")'\nmutate \"clamp-w-to-zero\"         's=s.replace(\"let stride: c_int = w.wrapping_mul\",\"let w = w.max(0);\\n    let stride: c_int = w.wrapping_mul\")'\nmutate \"alpha-from-wrong-index\"  's=s.replace(\"let a = f32::from(*base.add(3))\",\"let a = f32::from(*base.add(0))\")'\nmutate \"step-by-3\"               's=s.replace(\"i.wrapping_add(PIXEL_SIZE as c_int)\",\"i.wrapping_add(3)\")'\nmutate \"div-by-256\"              's=s.replace(\"/ 255.0f32;\\n    let mut r\",\"/ 256.0f32;\\n    let mut r\")'\nmutate \"aligned-field-read\"      's=s.replace(\"core::ptr::read_unaligned(core::ptr::addr_of!((*img).w))\",\"(*img).w\")'\ncp \"$BAK\" src/lib.rs; timeout 600 cargo build --release --offline >/dev/null 2>&1\necho; echo \"restored:\"; diff -q src/lib.rs \"$BAK\" && echo IDENTICAL","description":"Re-run expanded mutation suite plus debug null-guard check"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":726,"cache_read_input_tokens":105314,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":726,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"pare