HECKS PASSED\u001b[0m\n\n### test totals ###\n  passed=66 failed=0 ignored=0\n\n### symbol diff (authoritative) ###\n  EMPTY DIFF: every C symbol is exported by Rust\n\n### row counts vs tests ###\n  CONFIGS.md rows: 32 (unchecked: 0)\n  ERRORS.md  rows: 25 (unchecked: 0)\n  differential.rs tests: 33\ntests/errors.rs:29\ntests/features.rs:2\ntests/symbols.rs:4\ntests/differential.rs:32","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
